---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Start MCP server (JSON-RPC over stdio)

Usage: specforge mcp [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]
          Where to find the project to serve: the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json (none: nothing is served until a call names a project or init creates one)
          
          [default: .]

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
